        <p class="text-ink-2 leading-[1.65] mb-4">For a deeper comparison of the delivery models, see our <a href="/canvas-ugc/" class="text-accent hover:underline">complete Canvas UGC guide</a>. The key difference from an earnings perspective: traditional UGC is trading time for money (more clients = more income, linearly). Canvas UGC is trading performance for money (better content = more views = exponentially more income). Many successful creators do both &mdash; traditional UGC for baseline income and Canvas UGC for upside.</p>
